obs The witness reads behavior, not internal state: a committed verb's viewed image equals that verb applied by hand byte-for-byte; a two-verb stack tracks the replay; a full rewind recovers the source; a commit while rewound forgets the redo tail. HUNK16 GREEN beneath, TAME bans clean, width exit 0.
